reset

## One period of a detuned-structure (DS) disk-loaded waveguide cell, quarter
## model, meshed for a periodic-boundary (PBC) eigensolve.
##
## Adapted from the ACE3P tutorial 'omega3p/dlwg-pbc' example, which splits this
## into step1-Make-DS-cell.jou (build the cell, export three .sat models) and
## step2a-pbc-mesh_1fourth.jou (import the quarter model, mesh it, set sidesets,
## export pbc-4.gen). LUME-ACE3P plays ONE journal per cubit module, so the two
## are joined here, the ACIS round-trip is dropped, and only the quarter model
## the eigensolve uses is built (the tutorial's full and eighth models are not).
## The 'compress ids' before the mesh half is what keeps the surface, curve and
## vertex IDs it references valid: it renumbers the surviving entities
## contiguously, which is the numbering an export/import pair also produces.

## --- geometry (was step1-Make-DS-cell.jou) --------------------------------- #

#{a         =  4.54700   }
#{b         = 11.10551   }
#{t         =  3.90124   }
#{anose     =  2.39936   }
#{cell_height = 10.93431}

cylinder radius {b} height {cell_height - t}
cylinder radius {a} height {cell_height}
unite all
compress ids

modify curve 6 5 blend radius {0.5*t}

## quarter model
webcut body all plane xplane
del body 2
compress ids
webcut body all plane yplane
del body 1
compress ids

## --- mesh (was step2a-pbc-mesh_1fourth.jou) -------------------------------- #

volume 1 scheme tetmesh

volume 1 size 2.0

## nose
surface 5 6 size 1.
## b
surface 9   size 1.

mesh surface 2

## The periodic master/slave surfaces (sidesets 3 and 4) must carry IDENTICAL
## meshes for Omega3P's Periodic_M / Periodic_S boundary pair, so surface 4's
## mesh is copied from surface 2 rather than generated independently.
copy Mesh Surface 2 Onto Surface 4 source curve 10 target curve 17 source vertex 9 target vertex 10

mesh volume 1

sideset 3 surface 2
sideset 4 surface 4
sideset 1 surface 3
sideset 2 surface 1
sideset 6 surface all except 2 4 3 1

block 1 vol all
block 1 element type tetra10
transform mesh output scale 0.001

export genesis "pbc-4.gen" overwrite
